  "text": "AFK Helwyr Hard Mode\n\n​\nDisclaimer\n⬥ IF YOU CANNOT GET A METHOD TO WORK DO NOT MESSAGE THE CREATOR(S)\n‎ ‎ ‎ ‎• It is more than likely user error or cutting corners, use #pvm-help if you cannot get it to work\n​\nMelee AFK Method (50+ kph) \nPositioning\n\n⬥ Always start on center Mushroom.\n​\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\nMandatory Requirements\n\n⬥ The following ARE REQUIRED for this method to work:\n    • Cutting corners will result in failure\n    • A more extensive list can be found in #unknown-channel\n\nItems\n⬥ Igneous Kal-ket \n⬥ Scrimshaw of Vampyrism \n⬥ Enhanced excalibur \n⬥ Weapon Poison +++ \n⬥ Kwuarm incense sticks \n⬥ Champion's Ring  + Enchantment of Heroism\n⬥ Enhanced Gloves of Passage \n⬥ Jaws of the Abyss \n⬥ Am-Hej \nOther\n⬥ Totem of Vitality  and Boon of Het HP Boosts required.\n⬥ Hellhound familiar \n    • Legendary Pet requires  + .\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n​\nPresets and Relics\n⬥ Melee \n​\nAction Bar\n\n​\nExample Kills\n⬥ High Level AFK Melee\n⬥ Low Level AFK Melee\n​\n      \n    ",
  "normalizedText": "AFK Helwyr Hard Mode ​ Disclaimer ⬥ IF YOU CANNOT GET A METHOD TO WORK DO NOT MESSAGE THE CREATOR(S) ‎ ‎ ‎ ‎• It is more than likely user error or cutting corners, use #pvm-help if you cannot get it to work ​ Melee AFK Method (50+ kph) Positioning ⬥ Always start on center Mushroom. ​ Mandatory Requirements ⬥ The following ARE REQUIRED for this method to work: • Cutting corners will result in failure • A more extensive list can be found in #unknown-channel Items ⬥ Igneous Kal-ket ⬥ Scrimshaw of Vampyrism ⬥ Enhanced excalibur ⬥ Weapon Poison +++ ⬥ Kwuarm incense sticks ⬥ Champion's Ring + Enchantment of Heroism ⬥ Enhanced Gloves of Passage ⬥ Jaws of the Abyss ⬥ Am-Hej Other ⬥ Totem of Vitality and Boon of Het HP Boosts required. ⬥ Hellhound familiar • Legendary Pet requires + . ​ Presets and Relics ⬥ Melee ​ Action Bar ​ Example Kills ⬥ High Level AFK Melee ⬥ Low Level AFK Melee ​",
